  "description": "A proper trail e-mountain bike that weighs from just 36.6 pounds.\n\nLauf eElja and a Lauf Seigla gravel bike weigh about as much (combined) as many competing electric mountain bikes. Now, let that sink in.\n\nWhether your ride has huge climbs or big miles, the eElja delivers hours of power and its LSP suspension handles anything you throw at it.\n\nLight-yet-powerful and incredibly quiet TQ HPR60 drive system.\n\neElja comes with a 360Wh internal battery and the Long Range editions come with a 160Wh Range Extender battery, for a total of 520Wh. Combine this with eElja's low weight and the TQ HPR60 efficiency, and you get monstrous range.\n\nFully wireless control, using SRAM AXS Pods to control shifting, dropper post, and assist modes, giving you the ultimate in simplicity and the cleanest cockpit ever.",
